script = ExtResource("1_q6su2")
dialogue_id = "debate_ichi_go_ichi_e"
record_title = "Debate Speech: A Culture of Tea"
text = "PAGE: historian(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
historian: There's a shard out there in the Cloud Sea with a centuries-long tea tradition.
historian: Apparently, you cannot walk ten paces there without bumping into a tea house.
historian: They even hold town council meetings in them.
historian: But the funny thing is, they don't much care about the tea itself.
historian: They just pluck whatever leaves are growing nearby, toss them in hot water, and call it a day.
historian: Some may say that these people have taken the easy way out, given up on achieving a truly masterful drink.
historian: But I think they are a wise people who saw the true meaning in sharing a drink.
historian: Instead of chasing unattainable perfection, they pay attention to the joy already in their grasp.
historian: The joy of sitting on a worn cushion and laughing at a neighbor's jokes.
historian: We could spend lifetimes trying to rebuild a perfect world, but in the process, won't we miss the ordinary, imperfect beauty sitting right in front of us?"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
